# ForgeShape — repository ignore rules.
#
# Rule: generated output, machine-local configuration and transient tool state
# are ignored. Source, shaders, tests, repository documentation, the Gradle
# wrapper and the referenced evidence artifacts are versioned.

# --- Transient instrumented-run state ---
# Checkpoints and per-shard logs the test runner writes per tested fingerprint.
# The evidence a stage cites is copied into its own artifacts folder; these are
# working files for a run in progress.
/artifacts/instrumented-runs/

# --- Gradle build output and local caches ---
/build/
/app/build/
.gradle/
gradle-app.setting
local.gradle.properties

# --- CMake / NDK generated output ---
/app/.cxx/
.cxx/
.externalNativeBuild/
CMakeCache.txt
CMakeFiles/
cmake_install.cmake

# --- Machine-local SDK/NDK configuration ---
local.properties
/keystore.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# --- Packaged application output ---
*.apk
*.aab
*.ap_
*.dex
*.so.dbg

# --- Android Studio / IntelliJ local state ---
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
/out/
captures/
.navigation/

# --- Claude Code / tool-local transient state ---
/.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
/.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Transient logs and emulator/device-local scratch ---
*.log
# ... except a stage's evidence logs, which its INDEX cites and which must be
# readable from the repository. Without this the rule above silently dropped
# every focused/*.log and startup.log from UI-PREF-R1's evidence commit while
# its own documents referenced them. Run state under
# artifacts/instrumented-runs/ stays excluded: an excluded DIRECTORY cannot be
# re-included by a later negation, which is exactly the behaviour wanted there.
!/artifacts/**/*.log
/logs/
/scratch/
/tmp/
hs_err_pid*
*.hprof

# --- OS noise ---
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# NOTE: /artifacts/ is deliberately NOT ignored. PROJECT_STATUS.md and PRODUCT.md
# cite those screenshots by filename as the runtime evidence for accepted stages,
# so they are versioned repository content rather than transient output.
